flowchart LR
  A[Receive code] --> B[BEGIN transaction]
  B --> C[SELECT pairing row FOR UPDATE]
  C --> D{Exists, unused, unexpired?}
  D -- No --> E[ROLLBACK and return error]
  D -- Yes --> F[Insert paired device]
  F --> G[Mark code consumed]
  G --> H[COMMIT and return token]
  I[Concurrent consume request] --> C
  C -. waits for row lock .-> I
  H --> J[Waiting request sees used_at; returns conflict]
